Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.30,1:50:25.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《古墓丽影：源起之战》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.78,0:04:27.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不付钱 没得玩）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.68,0:05:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿呼加太太 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.73,0:05:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 劳拉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.07,0:13:30.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（克劳馥集团）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:09.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（因失踪宣告死亡）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.93,0:14:31.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（在此处签字）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.93,0:16:00.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（来自我人生终点的第一封信）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:52.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纪念理查德·克劳馥）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:29.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄罗斯 伊万诺夫·亚历山大）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:31.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中国 詹姆斯·冯）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:32.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美国 约翰逊·斯图尔特）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:45.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（看我）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.14,0:21:43.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（理查德 价钱是两万美元）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.82,0:21:46.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（陆仁 香港阿伯丁）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.35,0:21:55.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（典当行）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.99,0:24:07.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（香港）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.51,0:27:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.80,0:27:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我船上滚下去 快滚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.59,0:27:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.25,0:27:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.37,0:44:41.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴特纳）
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.58,1:11:03.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（运输机已出发）
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.85,1:47:17.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.85,1:47:21.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（劳拉·克劳馥）
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.91,1:49:05.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纪念理查德·克劳馥）
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.28,1:49:23.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴特纳 机密）
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.57,1:49:26.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴特纳）
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.71,1:49:36.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴特纳有限公司）
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.72,1:49:47.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（委托授权书）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.15,0:00:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,2009年5月17日\N{\fnArial\fs30}May 17th, 2009.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.42,0:00:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对卑弥呼的进一步研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Further research on Himiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.05,0:01:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,卑弥呼是日本历史上第一位女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to legend, Himiko, the first queen of Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说她是一名利用邪术\N{\fnArial\fs30}was a powerful sorceress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.36,0:01:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,统治国家的强大术士\N{\fnArial\fs30}who ruled her empire through dark magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她手指一挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}spreading death and destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.03,0:01:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能带来毁灭和死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the mere touch of her hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.93,0:01:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她的野心被挫败\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was only stopped by a single twist of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.34,0:01:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,卑弥呼手下的将士起兵反叛\N{\fnArial\fs30}An army of her own generals bound and dragged Himiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.71,0:01:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把她带到凶险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to an uninhabitable island.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.78,0:01:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔海的一座孤岛上\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the middle of the treacherous Devil's Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,至今卑弥呼被埋葬在高山之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, she remains entombed beneath the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在一张古老的地图上找到了蛛丝马迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a speck on an old map that no one else has.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's there,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.86,0:01:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待着得到释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting to be unleashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.80,0:01:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须第一个找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get there first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.07,0:01:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最不愿意做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it means doing the last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.90,0:01:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd ever want to do…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.57,0:01:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔下我的小劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving my Lara behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.61,0:01:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,作出决定吧 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta make decisions, Lara.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.08,0:01:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧发力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta make something happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵挡攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Counter-punching doesn't work for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.89,0:02:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须更有技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have the skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.56,0:02:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢了 泰瑞 - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, Terry. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.29,0:02:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Lara!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.90,0:02:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再跳舞 鼓起斗志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop dancing, start fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.73,0:02:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.37,0:02:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.02,0:02:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 劳拉 你行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice one, Lara! You've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 结束吧 - 还不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's over. - Isn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.46,0:02:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then get out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧认输\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Lara! Tap out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.79,0:03:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你像条虫一样被吊打\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got whupped, girl. You got whupped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.19,0:03:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪有吊打 - 好吧 没有被吊打\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not whupped. - Okay. Not whupped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是被碾压\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marmalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.13,0:03:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,碾压？她又不是什么超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Marmalized"? She's not a freakin' superhero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上是我让她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, I let her…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.57,0:03:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会记仇吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.11,0:03:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.45,0:03:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我玩的很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was fun actually!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.22,0:03:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次我一定赢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我碾压你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll marmalize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.13,0:03:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚会早点回来的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're home early tonight, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.56,0:03:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.53,0:03:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.33,0:03:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.53,0:03:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 谁偷了我的苹果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Who stole my apple?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.57,0:04:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,早该猜到是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should've known it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要偷你的苹果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I do a thing like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.07,0:04:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你自己买不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you can't afford your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.41,0:04:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到记录 你拖欠会费了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just seen you're behind with your payments.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.45,0:04:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰瑞 我保证会补交会费的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terry, look, I'll catch up on the payments, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.82,0:04:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会还你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.12,0:04:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,找份工作吧 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a job, Lara.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.16,0:04:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我穿成这样是为了搞笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I'm dressed like this for fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.89,0:04:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉 我真的很欣赏你 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you, Lara. I really do, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.07,0:05:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嗨 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 今天特别顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All good? - Yeah. Havin' a great day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.10,0:05:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 挺好 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,再问点别的 问她想不想去吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask her more. Ask her for dinner or something. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.15,0:05:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.55,0:05:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.22,0:05:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 没事啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么 叫你问不问\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your problem? Why didn't you ask her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.36,0:05:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎狐赛安排好了吗 罗格\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that fox hunt sorted, Rog?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, more or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.91,0:05:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有30个「猎狗」报名了 现在就差「狐狸」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got 30 hounds signed up. Just gotta find a fox now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough one, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,得找个骑得快的 比赛才有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need someone quick enough to make it interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.45,0:05:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 太慢就不好玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No fun if they ain't quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.28,0:05:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,又要傻傻的 以为自己能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But dumb enough to think they can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.05,0:05:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在打什么鬼主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you two plotting?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要办场猎狐赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna do a fox hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.22,0:06:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么赛 - 类似自行车赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A what? - Well, it's like a race.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,当「狐狸」的车手先跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except the fox gets a head start,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.86,0:06:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路上用油漆留下痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}leavin' a paint trail behind his bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.39,0:06:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让当「猎狗」的车手去追\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the baying hounds to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果油漆用完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they haven't caught him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.73,0:06:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎狗却还没抓到狐狸\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the time the paint runs out…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.06,0:06:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,奖金就全归狐狸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wins all the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,奖金有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much money?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.57,0:06:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,600块\N{\fnArial\fs30}600 quid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要找的狐狸就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you just found yourself a fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're bein' serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.18,0:06:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不够快 还是不够傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not quick or dumb enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.81,0:06:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean, I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.98,0:06:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,狐狸藏好 大家来找\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hide fox, and all after!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎翁名句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, Shakespeare?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,出自哈姆雷特 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hamlet, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.89,0:06:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 脑子里冒出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know. Things just stick in my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你读过哈姆雷特吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it's Hamlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.43,0:06:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再问你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I ask you once again,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.03,0:06:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要当送外卖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}why on earth are you a bike courier?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.27,0:06:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.90,0:06:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想待在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna be close to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,54321 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, four, three, two, one! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.96,0:08:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,走走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她人呢 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.11,0:09:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会很久的 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be long, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看着点路 - 你才该看着点后视镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oi! Watch where you're going! - Use your mirrors!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到会在这儿见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fancy seeing you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ana.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.85,0:09:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用特地过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't have to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.39,0:09:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不需要监护人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need a guardian anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.62,0:09:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干油漆活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been decorating?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.27,0:10:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很久没见你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't seen you for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.30,0:10:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就没见过真正的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never seen me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.15,0:10:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was today about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.12,0:10:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要那笔奖金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't. There's an inheritance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一大笔遗产等着你去继承 只要你愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting for you if only you would step…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.02,0:10:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.33,0:10:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经过去七年了 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been seven years, Lara.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,东京警方五年前就已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tokyo police stopped looking for your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.67,0:10:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃搜寻你爸爸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.13,0:10:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,连私家侦探都不肯再接我们的委托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Private investigators won't even take our money anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 这很难接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's difficult to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.01,0:10:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你真的必须来把那些文件签了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you really must come in and sign those papers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.01,0:10:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是为此而来的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. That's why you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是为你而来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I came for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.52,0:10:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想你能为这个世界做多少贡献\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just think what you can do for the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.75,0:10:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭你的能力 凭你的财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your potential, with your wealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他的财富不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wealth. Not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么跟你说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, it's very simple…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.56,0:11:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不签署那些文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't sign the papers,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.70,0:11:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸奋斗一生的成果都会被拍卖掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}then everything your father worked for will be sold off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是他的公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just the company,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.91,0:11:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有克劳馥庄园\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Croft Manor, also.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要知道你把庄园弄丢了 他会怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you imagine how he would feel if you lost the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.72,0:11:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉 你爸爸已经不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lara, your father's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你可以接受他未竟的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.83,0:11:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是血脉相承的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.67,0:11:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.34,0:11:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那克劳馥的一类人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just not that kind of Croft.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.89,0:12:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想你走 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't want you to go, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.89,0:12:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会去很久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be long, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.43,0:12:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.43,0:12:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们克劳馥家族肩负重任 还有使命需要完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}We Crofts, we have responsibilities, jobs to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.34,0:12:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.04,0:12:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我也会想你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'll miss you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.54,0:12:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个解决办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I may have a solution to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见这个没\N{\fnArial\fs30}See this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.51,0:12:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你妈妈的 它拥有特殊的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was your mother's, so it has special powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.35,0:12:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你想见某个人时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever you want to feel close to someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把它紧紧握在手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}just put it in your hand, and you hold it tightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.59,0:12:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在心里想着那个人 对方就会感应到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think of that person, and they'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.79,0:12:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有魔力 有了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.03,0:12:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我去了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it means that we'll always be together,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.13,0:12:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都能心灵相通\N{\fnArial\fs30}wherever I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.13,0:12:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.34,0:13:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸一转眼就回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back before you know I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.37,0:13:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,送外卖走后门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couriers round the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.11,0:13:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是送外卖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm not a courier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.68,0:13:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.45,0:13:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 所以走后门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. So round the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.96,0:13:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来见安娜·米勒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to see Ana Miller.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你得和别人一样先登记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you gotta sign in like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.93,0:13:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lara.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.76,0:13:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lara.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.17,0:13:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳馥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Croft.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.64,0:14:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要签名的那几页已经标注出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pages that require a signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.37,0:14:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,方便您翻阅\N{\fnArial\fs30}are marked for your convenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.88,0:14:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要让亚夫先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like Mr. Yaffe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你解释一下细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take you through the particulars?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我这一签\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gather I sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.99,0:14:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就意味着爸爸彻底死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Dad is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这对你来说有多难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can imagine how difficult this is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.86,0:14:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很想他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.41,0:14:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是我爸爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Dad's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 克劳馥小姐 根据理查德的遗嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Miss Croft. According to Richard's will,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他过世之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the event of his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把这个转交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was to give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.69,0:14:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,机关盒 一种日本的解密游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karakuri. Japanese puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:14:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格意义上来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, technically speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.29,0:15:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,您必须先在文件上签字\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're meant to sign the papers first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.20,0:15:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不懂你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could never understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么对这些东西那么着迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}your father's obsession with those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.24,0:15:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't believe how many of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里还有多少这样的玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}were lying around the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.91,0:15:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这背后肯定有什么玄机\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was gonna be some purpose to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自我人生终点的第一封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The first letter from my final destination."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.55,0:15:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他并没有留下什么信件\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he didn't leave a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.76,0:16:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 失陪一下 - 劳拉 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you'll excuse me. - Lara, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.41,0:16:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我人生的终点\N{\fnArial\fs30}"My final destination."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个字母\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你到底要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, what were you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 小不点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, sprout.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.23,0:18:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你能解开我的谜题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I could trust you to solve my puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.79,0:18:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸 如果你正在看着带子的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, if you're watching this tape,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那意味着我已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then, uh, it means that I must be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.94,0:19:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你应该知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be obvious to you by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.77,0:19:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}that there was more to my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.77,0:19:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅只有董事会和生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}than just boardrooms and business deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.84,0:19:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事之前没法告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things that I couldn't tell you about before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.01,0:19:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈去世的时候 我悲痛欲绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your mother died, grief nearly destroyed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.12,0:19:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始四处搜寻 渴望找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I began searching the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.18,0:19:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个世界的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}desperate for a hint of another realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.29,0:19:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明超自然现象是存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for proof that the supernatural is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.36,0:19:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我感觉你妈妈还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything to feel her with me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.83,0:19:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对此产生了极大的兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made quite a hobby of it, sprout.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.40,0:19:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮我一个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你 把我所有关卑弥呼的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to burn all my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.51,0:19:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部烧掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the Himiko project.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.77,0:19:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的笔记本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just burn all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.71,0:19:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,录像带通通烧掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The notebooks, the tapes, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.28,0:19:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,事关重大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.98,0:19:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果落入坏人手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it falls into the wrong hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.62,0:19:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,会引发大灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}then it could be catastrophic,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.05,0:19:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以求你了 一定要全部烧掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}so please do it straightaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不喜欢听别人指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you hate being told what to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可求你了 一定要答应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but please promise me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.26,0:19:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望你永远不会看到这卷带子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you never have to see this tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.30,0:20:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现了我用生命守护的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've found my secret calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.30,0:20:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你也能找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you find yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.94,0:20:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,卑弥呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Himiko."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.18,0:20:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,10月5日\N{\fnArial\fs30}October 5th.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.22,0:20:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫卑弥呼为「死神之母」\N{\fnArial\fs30}They called Queen Himiko the "Mother of Death."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:20:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于她的所有故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the stories about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.92,0:21:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,结局都是血流成河\N{\fnArial\fs30}end in rivers running red with blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.86,0:21:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她蛊惑人心 控制人的意念\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bewitching people, controlling minds,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.06,0:21:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只需用手轻轻一碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}spreading death and destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.93,0:21:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,便可散布死亡与毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}with just the touch of her hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到她手下的将军把他活埋在坟墓里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bloodshed only ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮才得以终止\N{\fnArial\fs30}when her own generals buried her alive in a tomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.23,0:21:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把她埋在一个与世隔绝的小岛上\N{\fnArial\fs30}sealing her away from the outside world,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此不见天日\N{\fnArial\fs30}on an island no one could reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.17,0:21:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史上没有留下坟墓存在的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}History's all but erased its existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.74,0:21:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,遗落的邪马台岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lost island of Yamatai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.11,0:21:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定就是这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm certain this is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.85,0:21:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,2011年7月29日\N{\fnArial\fs30}July 29th, 2011.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.65,0:21:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,总算有个船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I finally found a captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.39,0:21:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯带我去那座小岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}willing to take me to the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.42,0:21:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须第一个找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must get there first to ensure her powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.19,0:21:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保她的强大力量不会落入坏人手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}will never fall into the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.15,0:22:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个护身符是日本昭和天皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}That amulet was given to my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.55,0:22:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,送给我父亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}by Emperor Showa of Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.92,0:22:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Right. Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.19,0:22:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这个玩意不是日本的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't from Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.69,0:22:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.39,0:22:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,昭和天皇是从古代马拉塔国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emperor Showa was given it by the grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.16,0:22:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,的孙子那儿得到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the former emperor of Maratha.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.93,0:22:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,马拉塔 你在开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Maratha"? You're having a laugh, in't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.93,0:22:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位王孙又是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he, himself, got it from Thibaw,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.73,0:22:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,从缅甸的末代国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}the last king of Burma.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.10,0:22:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,被流放到印度的锡袍王那儿得到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he was exiled in India.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.94,0:22:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,被流放到印度\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Exiled in India."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.97,0:22:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,故事很精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a fascinating tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.84,0:22:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的这些都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you got all this, uh, provenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.91,0:22:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,材料证明出处吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}down on paper, do ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.54,0:22:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有证明材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had the provenance on paper,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.25,0:22:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就拿去克里斯蒂拍卖行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be at Christie's, wouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.31,0:22:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.48,0:22:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天你撞大运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.39,0:22:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦 我警告过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan! What have I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.49,0:22:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许跟客人调情\N{\fnArial\fs30}about flirting with the customers?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.49,0:22:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没在调情 这是我自然流露的魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not flirting. I'm just naturally charismatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.06,0:22:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没在调情 别见怪 我没在调情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was not flirting. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.79,0:22:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在调情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was flirting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.63,0:22:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.81,0:22:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,亮出笑容 亲和随意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big smiles, nice and casual.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.97,0:23:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, well, I'm pleased to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.88,0:23:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们愿意收购你这件东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're in a position to make you an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.48,0:23:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.45,0:23:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.99,0:23:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a tad bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.79,0:23:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我爸爸留给我的唯一念想\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I have to remember my dad by.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.92,0:23:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸死了 太不幸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Oh, your dad died.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.66,0:23:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘家年纪轻轻就没了爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a shame. It's a terrible thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.26,0:23:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a young woman to lose her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.03,0:23:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 看在这份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really. All right. Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.20,0:23:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,9000英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}9, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.37,0:23:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才说是一万\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just said 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.60,0:23:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这演死老爸苦情戏的人多了去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, people come in here trying the dead dad shit all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每次都信以为真 艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you fall for it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.51,0:23:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我哪有每次都信以为真 - 不 你就是有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't fall for it all the time. - Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.31,0:23:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就被骗了两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last week, you fell for it twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.71,0:23:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,上个星期你就会骗了两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fell for it twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.85,0:23:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.58,0:23:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我很乐意继续讨价还价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. I'm happy to keep negotiating.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.32,0:23:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是8000了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because now the price is eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.22,0:23:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 你赢了 - 这不就结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. You win. - Ah, finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.92,0:23:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打心眼里感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Really.Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.93,0:23:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为你这种人准备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For just such occasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.53,0:23:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为你这种人准备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For just such occasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.57,0:24:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她烫到我的蛋蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You burnt me taters!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.07,0:24:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,收敛点吧 艾伦 太不像话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort yourself out, Alan. Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.47,0:24:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面是热咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is hot coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.47,0:24:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 你们会说英语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, do you speak English?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.04,0:24:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.78,0:24:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吗 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.85,0:24:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.68,0:24:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问你认识一个叫陆仁的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know a Lu Ren? Lu Ren?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.92,0:24:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,陆仁 一点也没听说过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even a tiny bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.43,0:25:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 你会说英语吗 - 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you speak English? - Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.76,0:25:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need help?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.63,0:25:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.27,0:25:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找一个叫陆仁的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for this guy called Lu Ren.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.04,0:25:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, he's supposed to…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.77,0:25:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 陆仁的船 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lu Ren boat. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.88,0:25:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍耐号 就在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Endurance. Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.34,0:25:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍耐号是哪条船\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Endurance"? Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.65,0:25:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.84,0:26:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.48,0:26:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把包还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimme the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.66,0:26:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的小费就别想要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just lost your tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.10,0:26:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的舌头别想要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just lose your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.27,0:27:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,陆仁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lu! Lu Ren!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.51,0:27:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.53,0:27:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 他又喝高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Run! He's drunk again!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.03,0:27:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.74,0:27:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.50,0:27:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你在我船上干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said what are you doing on my boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.11,0:28:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他们不是一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.71,0:28:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找陆仁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for a man named Lu Ren.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.74,0:28:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你找到我了 现在滚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, you found me. Now get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.51,0:28:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,请等一下 先听我说几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Wait. Just listen. I need…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.45,0:28:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 快点走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.19,0:28:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来找麻烦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to make any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.29,0:28:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚别停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.19,0:28:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能请你先把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you please put that gun down and just…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.86,0:28:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,活见鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.63,0:28:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲理查德·克劳馥在你这儿买过一艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father, Richard Croft, tried to buy a boat from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.50,0:28:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有在我这买过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. Not me, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.64,0:28:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他买过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.48,0:28:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫陆仁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name is Lu Ren.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.35,0:28:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的字据\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.95,0:28:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我知道自己叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know my name, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.95,0:28:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟我爸爸同名 这是他写的 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the same as my father's, and he wrote that, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.43,0:28:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我找他有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I need to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.39,0:28:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你 他还有一大堆债主\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and 100 other people he owed money…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.43,0:28:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在哪里 - 我不知道！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is he? - I don't know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.63,0:28:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天他开着船就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, he just left on his boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.63,0:29:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也没有见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I never saw him again, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.34,0:29:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是七年前的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was this seven years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.51,0:29:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们两个爸爸去哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know where they went. Our dads.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.45,0:29:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,去冰冷的海底了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the bottom of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.42,0:29:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是去找一座无人岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were headed to an uninhabited island.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.72,0:29:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在日本沿海海域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere off the coast of Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.46,0:29:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去叫邪马台岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It used to be called Yamatai.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.26,0:29:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要到那去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go there and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.53,0:29:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄清楚他们出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}what happened to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.07,0:29:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck. There's at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.70,0:29:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,日本沿海至少有6000座岛屿\N{\fnArial\fs30}6, 000 islands off the coast of Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.50,0:29:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本都是无人岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hardly any of them are populated.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.47,0:29:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧 我有地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I have a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.51,0:29:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要搞清楚这些是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, all I need to do is to figure out what these are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.98,0:29:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为这是岛屿所在地的坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think these are coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.05,0:29:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是钟表指针\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're clock hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.66,0:29:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是钟表指针\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not clock hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.59,0:29:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能是钟表指针呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely not clock hands. They're…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.90,0:30:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是钟表指针\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are clock hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.87,0:30:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.42,0:30:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.75,0:30:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在恶魔海的正中央\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right in the middle of the Devil's Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.82,0:30:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不如在脚上绑块石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might as well tie a stone to your foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.42,0:30:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接跳海来得痛快\N{\fnArial\fs30}and jump off the boat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.96,0:30:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一场冒险之旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be an adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.56,0:30:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,送死可不叫冒险之旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death is not an adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.99,0:30:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想知道他们的下落吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want to know what happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.83,0:30:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对我来说已经不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't care anymore, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.57,0:30:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忙得很 有很多事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm a busy guy. I got stuff to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.65,0:31:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚输了多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much did you lose last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.36,0:31:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凭什么认为我输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think I lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.36,0:31:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你看起来像在借酒消愁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it looked like you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.93,0:31:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像在庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}drowning your sorrows, not celebrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.62,0:31:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我去邪马台 这钱就归你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours if you help me get to Yamatai.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.32,0:31:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我拿去买棺材吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what will I spend it on, a coffin?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.06,0:31:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就拿这笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll go and get myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.66,0:31:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,去自己买两条你这种破船\N{\fnArial\fs30}two rust buckets like this with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.39,0:31:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你有一条船 或者两条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you had a boat, or two,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.53,0:31:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没等你开出港口 船就沉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd sink 'em before you even left the harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.06,0:31:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要一个经验丰富的船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you need is an experienced captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.41,0:31:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你另外一只鞋里藏了什么 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's in the other shoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.08,0:32:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,6月23日\N{\fnArial\fs30}June 23rd.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.99,0:32:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能又找到了一条线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have found the next piece to the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.95,0:32:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些古画指向墓穴的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ancient drawings hint to the location of the tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.69,0:32:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一扇设计精妙的大门将她与世隔绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}and an elaborate door to keep her contained.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.90,0:32:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了破译密码的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've found a way to decipher the codes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.33,0:32:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定能够找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure I can get to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.08,0:32:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据古代编年史记载\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ancient Nihongi chronicles state.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.54,0:32:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入墓穴的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that within the tomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.45,0:32:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须面对卑弥呼的严峻考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}one must face the "Ordeals of Himiko."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.58,0:32:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,跨越灵魂的鸿沟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cross the Chasm of Souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.85,0:32:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷在卑弥呼的八张面具下幸存\N{\fnArial\fs30}pray to survive the faces of Himiko,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.99,0:32:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,见证由她的千名侍女组成的大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}behold her army of a thousand handmaidens,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.10,0:32:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,降临在卑弥呼最后的安息之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}descend upon Himiko's final resting place,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.77,0:32:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放她的灾祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}unleashing her scourge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.05,0:33:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,7月6日\N{\fnArial\fs30}July 6th. I'm convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.98,0:33:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定有人在监视我的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my progress is being monitored.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.42,0:33:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我知道他们是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know them by name now…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.22,0:33:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣三一秘社\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Order of Trinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.95,0:33:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是一个好战的古老组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}An ancient militant organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.02,0:33:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻求操纵自然力量的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}that seeks control over the supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.89,0:33:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,从而统治全人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}to rule the fate of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.19,0:33:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果卑弥呼就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if Himiko is the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.53,0:33:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣三一想要寻找的武器呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Trinity has been seeking?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.51,0:33:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡不着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.05,0:33:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,景色真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.32,0:33:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁现在多看几眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy it while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.19,0:33:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后就要进入香港和加州之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're headed into the most dangerous stretch of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.06,0:33:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,最危险的海域了\N{\fnArial\fs30}between Hong Kong and California.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.83,0:33:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸真会挑度假的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad sure knew how to pick a holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.80,0:34:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 显然他就喜欢干出人意料的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He had a knack for the unexpected. Apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.94,0:34:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我开始怀疑 他是不是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am starting to wonder if he'd gone mad, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.31,0:34:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像分不清虚实真假\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't seem to know what was real and what wasn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.95,0:34:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉迷于一个古代日本的死亡女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}obsessing over some ancient Japanese death queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.55,0:34:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的男人就是喜欢危险的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, some men like dangerous women.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.16,0:34:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的男人真的很蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some men are foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.99,0:34:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.63,0:34:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 陆仁 做个好梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Lu Ren. Sweet dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.48,0:34:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,离神射手威廉·泰尔还有一步之遥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not William Tell yet, but you're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.41,0:34:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉·泰尔只是传说 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}William Tell was a myth, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.62,0:34:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个传说都有一定的现实基础\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, all myths have foundation in reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.69,0:34:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出远门了 小不点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to head off, sprout.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.42,0:34:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你才刚刚回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've only just come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.19,0:34:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸一转眼就回来了 - 我甚至不知道你都走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be back before… - I even know you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.59,0:35:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜会照顾你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ana will keep an eye on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.43,0:35:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你派员工来给我当保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need one of your employees babysitting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.76,0:35:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己能照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.21,0:35:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.11,0:35:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lara.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.25,0:35:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要忘记爸爸爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never forget Dad loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.12,0:35:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.53,0:36:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道会吵醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought that might wake you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.30,0:36:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的岛就在前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your island's found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.98,0:36:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪马台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yamatai.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.82,0:36:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,船只失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost all control!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.66,0:36:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得弃船了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need to abandon ship. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.86,0:36:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿只有死路一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dead in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.60,0:36:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,船支持不了多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna hold much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.13,0:36:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须马上离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get off this boat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.42,0:37:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.72,0:37:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸的笔记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's papers!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.25,0:37:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拿了 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget them! Lara!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.51,0:37:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lara. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.45,0:37:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,陆仁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lu!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.80,0:37:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,救生船\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lifeboat!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.82,0:38:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.43,0:38:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,陆仁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lu!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.46,0:38:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,陆仁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lu!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.81,0:40:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.61,0:40:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! She's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.51,0:40:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始我还很担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was beginning to get worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.23,0:40:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为礁石\N{\fnArial\fs30}A reef.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.33,0:40:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撞了上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.09,0:40:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸亏我发现了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.16,0:40:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,想来这里的人都死在了激流之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people who try to come here die in the currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.07,0:40:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎不可能活着到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost impossible to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.20,0:40:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别提回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even harder to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.38,0:40:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的包呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.95,0:40:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.96,0:41:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里干什么 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here, Lara?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.86,0:41:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有两个女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have two daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.13,0:41:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,发色和你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark hair like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.00,0:41:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你一样漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.48,0:41:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 忘了自我介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me. Rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.18,0:41:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里很久没来客人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't hosted a guest here in a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.88,0:41:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫马赛厄斯·沃格尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Mathias Vogel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.65,0:41:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定饿了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.66,0:41:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前常常在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I used to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.53,0:41:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这些罐头里\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I might find an ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.60,0:41:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迟早会吃到一只耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}inside one of those cans eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.97,0:41:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.47,0:41:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这岛上过了那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess being on this island for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.84,0:41:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不发疯才怪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}can make you a little crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.64,0:42:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一能说话的对象是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only person that I get to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.28,0:42:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话另一端的那些家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}is on the other end of this phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.02,0:42:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们总是重复一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they always say the same thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.92,0:42:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的工作完成前我不能回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go home until my work on the island is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.33,0:42:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的工作是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of work do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.34,0:42:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,各种各样的事 一切听我老板的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, a mix of things. At the mercy of my employer.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.00,0:42:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在找这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You looking for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.27,0:42:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运的女神总是会给我惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The machinations of fate never cease to amaze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.27,0:43:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,通往卑弥呼的大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The door to Himiko."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.94,0:43:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查德找到了入口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard had the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.12,0:43:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,得来全不费工夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that wasted time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.06,0:43:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把这个世界上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have brought me the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.62,0:43:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最想要的东西带给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I most wanted in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.66,0:43:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.80,0:43:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我爸爸多少事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.17,0:43:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们父女俩很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I see the likeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.07,0:43:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,都很聪明 长得也像\N{\fnArial\fs30}The intelligence in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.58,0:43:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的不计后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}The recklessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.45,0:43:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实合作一点就没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All he had to do was cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.52,0:43:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是理查德他拒绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, being Richard, he refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.52,0:43:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为自己在拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought he was saving the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.26,0:43:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.27,0:44:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.00,0:44:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在天上 我杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's with God now. I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.84,0:44:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是抱歉 我刚才太直接了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry if I was too blunt. I'm out of practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.11,0:44:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经七年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been seven years.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.65,0:44:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,七年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven years.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.73,0:44:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.23,0:44:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.80,0:44:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,到下面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Get down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.01,0:44:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,用推车来推\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get those skids moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.08,0:44:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.52,0:44:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.89,0:44:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,排好队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.99,0:44:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,捡起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.82,0:44:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 走 往前走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.66,0:45:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tie her up!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.98,0:45:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, winch it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.91,0:45:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.82,0:45:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉·克劳馥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lara Croft.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.22,0:45:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该来这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.32,0:45:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但很高兴你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm glad that you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.46,0:45:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾一下 我们转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack it up. We're moving camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.53,0:45:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 把东西都收拾好 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, let's pack it up! - Okay, move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.93,0:45:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾好 马上就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're moving camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.88,0:45:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快点 你 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it moving! You, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.38,0:45:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it, move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.36,0:46:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,动起来 快点 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick it up! Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.49,0:46:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.00,0:46:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的是遇到海难的渔夫 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some are shipwrecked fishermen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.47,0:46:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的给了人贩子钱 想偷渡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And some paid smugglers to take 'em to a better life.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.20,0:46:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果却被带到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, they brought 'em here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.41,0:46:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 都给我动作快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! We're backed up here. Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.31,0:46:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他杀了我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he killed my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.78,0:46:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.35,0:46:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.79,0:46:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,被他残忍的杀害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold-blooded murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.62,0:46:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.23,0:46:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该把你带到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry that I brought you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.70,0:46:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实利用了一个宿醉的水手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you did take advantage of a drunken sailor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.33,0:46:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.37,0:46:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我们还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least we're not dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.80,0:46:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.29,0:47:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这里需要几个架子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some CL 20 up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.24,0:47:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 动作快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.15,0:48:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.52,0:48:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他赶紧起来继续干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him up and back to work right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.08,0:48:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.89,0:48:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 趁现在 - 让他休息 我们替他干\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right now! - Let him rest. We'll manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.19,0:48:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他赶紧起来干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him back to work right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.69,0:48:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他生病了 伙计 需要休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's sick, man. He needs to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.52,0:49:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都回去干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.00,0:49:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到没有 全都回去干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard him! Let's get back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.01,0:49:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Lara.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.41,0:49:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉 准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lara! Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.48,0:49:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.81,0:49:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.00,0:50:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.91,0:50:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快追 动作快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's spread out! Spread out!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.03,0:50:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.50,0:50:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.63,0:50:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab her!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.80,0:51:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她掉进河里了 要我们去追吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in the river. You want us to follow?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.20,0:51:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.77,0:51:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我派火箭去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sending Rocket to track her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.01,0:51:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要是没死 火箭会抓他回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she survives, he'll bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.81,0:54:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.80,0:58:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动 乖乖跟我回营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy now, easy. I'm taking you back to camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.16,0:58:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再挣扎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop struggling!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.67,1:00:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.71,1:00:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.95,1:01:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not mad. I'm not mad, I'm not mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.52,1:01:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just ignore it. It'll go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.52,1:02:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.16,1:02:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.86,1:02:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.03,1:02:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是劳拉 你走开 像往常一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not real. Ignore it. It'll go away. It always does.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.34,1:02:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, look at me, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.74,1:02:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.45,1:02:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember this? Do you remember:
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.05,1:02:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.63,1:02:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.37,1:02:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Lara.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.77,1:03:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊喜啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sprout.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.68,1:03:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,天那 真的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the blazes are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.26,1:03:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我严重受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I'm hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.47,1:03:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.82,1:03:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比你更受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will hurt me more than it hurts you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.52,1:03:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.29,1:03:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.50,1:03:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all right. You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.27,1:04:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.24,1:04:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,天黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.92,1:04:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.52,1:04:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,守着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you stay with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.29,1:04:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪儿也不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.23,1:05:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vogel! We found it! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.37,1:05:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Come on! We found it!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.54,1:05:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.35,1:05:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,派运输机来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send the transport.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.05,1:06:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.69,1:06:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常在岛上见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually when I see you on this island,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.09,1:06:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知所踪的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's you who disappears.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.38,1:06:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.19,1:06:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.89,1:06:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你后来去了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, sprout, where did you end up?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.60,1:06:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛津还是剑桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you go to Oxford or Cambridge?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.70,1:06:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 是哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, which was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.77,1:06:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 爸爸 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.71,1:06:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没上大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't go to university.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.74,1:07:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 还有时间 你年纪还小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's time yet. You're still only a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.45,1:07:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你当年离开我的时候 我年纪还小\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I was a child when you left me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.42,1:07:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.83,1:07:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一生最艰难的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardest day of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.80,1:07:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是放弃回到你身边的那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I gave up trying to get back to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.70,1:07:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意识到她永远不会放我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I realized she'd never let me leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.78,1:07:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说些什么 她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? Who's "she"?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.85,1:07:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,卑弥呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Himiko.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.05,1:07:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣三一派沃格尔来找她的坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trinity had sent Vogel to find her tomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.25,1:07:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄醒她以获取她的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that he could wake her and get her power.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.72,1:07:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.39,1:07:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.66,1:07:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有我 沃格尔找不到坟墓的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vogel can't find the tomb without me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.40,1:07:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但既然我死了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.97,1:07:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我剩下的研究也全都被你烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and since you've burnt the rest of my research,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.67,1:08:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这辈子都找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll never find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.31,1:08:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.21,1:08:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}About that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.85,1:08:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你烧了我的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}What part of "burn all my papers"…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.82,1:08:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪个字听不懂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you not understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.95,1:08:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我烧了它们 我就找不到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'd burned the papers, I wouldn't have found you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.49,1:08:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到时候设置干扰和虚假线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I set diversions and false leads wherever I could.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.96,1:08:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年 我想尽办法误导他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched for years as they got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.59,1:08:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你却亲手给他们指了路\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you lead them by the hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.43,1:08:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不就是让一个手里有枪的精神病人 找到了某个遗迹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a gun-toting psychopath finds some ancient remains.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.47,1:08:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么大不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.24,1:08:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果沃格尔打开了坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Vogel opens that tomb,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.44,1:08:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,卑弥呼的诅咒就会被释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Himiko's curse will be unleashed on the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.04,1:08:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, listen…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.71,1:08:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里就是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming here was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.72,1:08:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这里 是为了弄清楚你发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here to find out what happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.36,1:08:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要坟墓是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long as the tomb was safe,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.69,1:08:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.89,1:08:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在努力保护你的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.30,1:09:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我却低估了你的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I underestimated your…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.07,1:09:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}My what?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.74,1:09:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 愚蠢吗 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stupidity? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.48,1:09:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bravery.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.15,1:09:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get off this island.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.29,1:09:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没办法离开 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way off, Lara.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.95,1:09:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃格尔有一部卫星电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vogel's got a satellite phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.89,1:09:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以拿过来 找人来救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can get to it. We can call for help.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.66,1:09:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃格尔有一支军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vogel has an army.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.39,1:09:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你教我永远不要放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the one who taught me to never give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.00,1:09:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,今时不同往日\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a different time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.67,1:09:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不是当年的我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a different man.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.95,1:09:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 劳拉 - 但我还是当年那个人的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lara. - Well, I'm still his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.25,1:09:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lara!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.58,1:10:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.90,1:10:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,换个组合试一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try another combination.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.67,1:10:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行再换\N{\fnArial\fs30}And another one, and another one.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.98,1:11:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 拜托 告诉我密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on, give me the damn code.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.16,1:11:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,再用炸药试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. We're trying the explosives again.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.93,1:11:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,去放炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set another charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.47,1:11:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.26,1:11:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,装炸药 别说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over there. Stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.24,1:11:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿上枪 我去拿卫星电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the guns. I'm gonna get the sat phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.54,1:11:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们想办法一起离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll find a way for all of us to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.81,1:12:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就走 赶快带他们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to leave now.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.99,1:12:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃格尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vogel! They re escaping!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.63,1:12:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.57,1:12:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,射他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot them!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.69,1:12:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带他们去安全的地方 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get them to safety. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.16,1:12:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会跟上的 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right behind you. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.24,1:13:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.69,1:13:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to move.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.56,1:13:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.89,1:13:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会丢下劳拉不管的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving Lara behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.32,1:14:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,很美吧 理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful, isn't it, Richard?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.76,1:14:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望早点知道你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I would've known that you were alive all these years.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.23,1:14:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少还能有个人陪我说说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I would've had somebody to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.85,1:14:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助 理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help, Richard.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.12,1:14:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我把大门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the door open for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.52,1:14:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,都已经七年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been seven years.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.75,1:14:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回家去见家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going home to see my family.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.52,1:15:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我开启了坟墓 你就没有家人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I open that tomb, you won't have a family.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.49,1:15:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.43,1:15:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.70,1:15:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.67,1:15:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,休想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.90,1:15:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.74,1:15:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮或不帮 我早晚都会进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}With or without you, I'm getting inside that tomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.49,1:15:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that down!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.02,1:15:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.76,1:15:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得弓箭会比枪快吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think I can pull this trigger before you hit me with that arrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.06,1:15:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他 劳拉 动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him, Lara. Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.20,1:15:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 把武器放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, put your weapon down.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.13,1:15:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手 劳拉 不能让他找到卑弥呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him, Lara. We can't let him get to Himiko.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.70,1:15:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该不会信他胡说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really don't believe this nonsense, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.57,1:15:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你爸爸开门 不然他就得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your father to open the door, or he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.38,1:15:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能说服他的 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can make him do it, Lara.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.41,1:15:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,运输机已经上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transport's already on its way.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.98,1:15:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以一起离开这座该死的岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can all be off this goddamn island.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.95,1:16:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.65,1:16:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲我一个能拯救成千上万的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sacrificing one life is worth saving millions.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.13,1:16:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己选吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.13,1:16:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,扣动扳机的是你的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your finger that's pulling this trigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.20,1:16:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.61,1:16:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这里 不是为了看你被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't come all this way to see you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.92,1:16:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.52,1:16:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮你开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.96,1:16:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳馥家里总算有个理智的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, a Croft with some sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.80,1:18:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士优先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies first.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.29,1:18:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,留好路标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mark the path.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.29,1:19:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还有气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.39,1:19:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能是由气压差产生的风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it's a change in atmospheric pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.03,1:19:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.18,1:19:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你脸上的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've seen the look on your…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.66,1:20:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在机关不是防止外来的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't designed to keep people out.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.20,1:20:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是为了阻止里面的人出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was put there to keep people in.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.24,1:20:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.30,1:20:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂的鸿沟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chasm of Souls.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.26,1:21:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go next.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.58,1:22:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷在卑弥呼的八张面具下幸存\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Pray to survive the faces of Himiko."
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.18,1:22:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,离得越来越近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.82,1:22:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡女王令白昼变成了黑夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Death Queen turns day to night.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.33,1:22:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯有她死亡 方能起死回生\N{\fnArial\fs30}"She must die to bring back life."
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.14,1:22:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.48,1:22:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心地面 - 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The floor! - Lara!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.52,1:22:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有办法让机关停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be a way to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.03,1:22:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,四处找一找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.47,1:22:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快找找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.67,1:22:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃格尔 你们那里怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vogel, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.99,1:23:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷幸存\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Pray to survive."
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.35,1:23:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个钥匙孔 需要一把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a keyhole. We need a key!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.36,1:23:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷是指转经筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prayer wheels!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.76,1:23:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lara!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.47,1:23:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.84,1:23:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看其他几个转经筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the other prayer wheels.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.37,1:23:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try this!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.88,1:23:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.38,1:23:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.12,1:23:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是颜色谜题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a color puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.12,1:23:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡女王令白昼变成了黑夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Death Queen turns the day to night."
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.39,1:23:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 黑色 - 黑色 给\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Black. - Black! Here!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.50,1:23:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.56,1:23:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.40,1:24:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.53,1:24:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.17,1:24:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.21,1:24:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lara!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.41,1:24:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后一个 黄色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last one! Yellow!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.62,1:24:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.39,1:24:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部试一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just try them all, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.59,1:24:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡女王令白昼变成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Death Queen turns the day to night."
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.53,1:24:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯有她死亡 方能起死回生\N{\fnArial\fs30}"She must die to bring back… Life."
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.63,1:24:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.80,1:24:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命的颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}The color of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.51,1:24:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脚下快没地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm running out of floor!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.35,1:24:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Green!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.74,1:25:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们家就数你最聪明 小不点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always were the brains of the family, sprout.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.32,1:25:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续前进吧 小不点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's get going, sprout.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.49,1:25:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,地面呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the floor?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.13,1:25:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.34,1:25:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,照明弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flare.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.73,1:26:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Lara.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.97,1:26:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going back for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.83,1:26:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.40,1:26:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸是为我们牺牲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dad gave his life for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.14,1:27:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,由卑弥呼的一千名侍女组成的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Himiko's army of a thousand handmaidens.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.32,1:27:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些侍女是为了给卑弥呼殉葬而自尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sacrificed themselves in ritual suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.65,1:27:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,死后继续侍奉她们的女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}to serve their queen in the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.83,1:27:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你笔记里写的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly as your notes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.50,1:27:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found her.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.99,1:27:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利就在眼前 赶紧把事办完\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, this is it. We're finishing this.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.86,1:27:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在回头还来得及\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not too late to change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.03,1:27:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说和现实是两码事 理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a very big difference between myth and reality, Richard.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.94,1:28:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脑子永远转不过这个弯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that you could never understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.81,1:28:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.29,1:28:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开棺木\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.04,1:29:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就说了 没什么好怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? I told you there was nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.68,1:29:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.51,1:29:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,小老太\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a little old lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.22,1:29:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备把她运走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare her for transport.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.66,1:29:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉哪里对不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something doesn't add up.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.53,1:29:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些壁画里的她 根本不像暴君\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not a monster in any of these paintings.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.47,1:29:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去是她自己要来岛上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like she was taking herself here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.31,1:29:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是被绑来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not being forced.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.18,1:29:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡女王令白昼变成了黑夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Death Queen turns day to night.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.52,1:29:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯有她死亡 方能起死回生\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must die to bring back life.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.92,1:29:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,起死回生\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Bring back life."
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.99,1:30:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只需用手轻轻一碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spreading death and destruction.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.86,1:30:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,便可散布死亡与毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}with just the touch of her hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.86,1:30:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,搬吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.53,1:30:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有传说都有一定的现实基础\N{\fnArial\fs30}All myths have foundation in reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.54,1:30:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现实基础\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.24,1:30:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我一个人 能拯救成千上万的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sacrificing one life is worth saving millions.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.77,1:30:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.94,1:30:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是自愿牺牲自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was sacrificing herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.85,1:30:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保护这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was protecting the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.17,1:30:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.70,1:30:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,忽悠人的东西罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smoke and mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.81,1:30:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 快点把她装起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's bag her up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.03,1:31:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,古代人误以为这是邪术\N{\fnArial\fs30}They thought it was magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.20,1:31:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实她是病毒携带者\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a carrier.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.64,1:31:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她自身对这种病毒免疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was immune.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.42,1:31:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种传染病\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a disease.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.57,1:32:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣三一想要的就是这个 有了这个 我就能回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what Trinity wants. This gets me home.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.91,1:32:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,被带到外面的世界 必然引发大屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you take this out into the world, it's genocide.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.25,1:32:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要拿着你身上的一小部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to take a very small piece of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.68,1:33:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去抓住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Get her! Get her!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.63,1:34:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,事已至此 理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is it, Richard.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.00,1:34:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开这里便算大功告成\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we have to do is walk out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.27,1:34:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪儿都别想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.62,1:34:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Richard.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.89,1:34:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想你女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.10,1:34:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.80,1:34:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.02,1:36:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad. - Lara.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.32,1:36:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃格尔跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vogel's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.09,1:36:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得赶紧去追他 - 我们一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need to go after him. - Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.06,1:36:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 别过来 - 你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, stay back. Stay back. - What are you talking…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.76,1:36:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done for.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.20,1:36:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm infected.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.94,1:36:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.48,1:37:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以碰我 别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't touch me. Don't touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.68,1:37:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须阻止沃格尔 然后离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must stop Vogel and get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.19,1:37:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把卑弥呼彻底埋葬\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll bury Himiko once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.26,1:37:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚才找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've only just found you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.92,1:37:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我 你会阻止他的 答应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me you'll stop him. Promise me!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.43,1:37:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定还有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be another way.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.06,1:37:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lara.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.80,1:37:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个聪明姑娘 应该明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a very, very bright young woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.93,1:37:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有别的办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no other way.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.01,1:37:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.25,1:37:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要 你能顶十个我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't. You're worth 10 of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.25,1:37:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前说你不相信魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you don't believe in magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.45,1:37:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道这还不算吗 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what's this, my darling?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.36,1:37:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this time here…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.63,1:37:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我多希望看到你长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wished I could see you grow up.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.36,1:37:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.96,1:37:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I have.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.03,1:37:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.33,1:37:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,打起精神 小不点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chin up, sprout.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.44,1:38:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有使命要完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's jobs to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.81,1:38:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.61,1:38:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no time, Lara.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.88,1:38:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.53,1:38:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad loves you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.50,1:38:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.86,1:39:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真要这么做吗 姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you really wanna do this, little girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.19,1:39:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.48,1:39:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你谁也救不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not savin' anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.11,1:39:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣三一无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trinity is everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.35,1:39:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.12,1:40:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应过他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.16,1:40:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.93,1:40:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死都别想出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.24,1:40:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.76,1:41:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you see Richard,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.47,1:41:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得替我问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}send him my regards.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.67,1:42:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己问候他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send them yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.19,1:42:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳馥家族可不是好惹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You messed with the wrong family.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.25,1:44:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lara!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.32,1:45:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lara!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.33,1:45:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lara?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.48,1:45:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.51,1:45:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我们还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.42,1:46:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.71,1:46:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃格尔 巴特纳B5运输机呼叫 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vogel, Vogel, this is Patna Transport Bravo 5. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.88,1:46:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃格尔 收到吗 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vogel, Vogel, are you reading me? Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.79,1:46:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.99,1:46:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来送我们回去的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're takin' us home, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.70,1:47:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,正式死亡 像做梦一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officially gone. Like magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.77,1:47:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他没有离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he has gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.51,1:47:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在你身上看到了他的影子 - 谢谢 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I see so much of him in you. - Thanks, Ana.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.81,1:47:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.15,1:47:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在由你做主了 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in charge now, Lara.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.98,1:47:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们公司的资产列表\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a list of all our assets.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.89,1:47:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.75,1:47:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得公司的日常事务还是你来管理吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think you'd better stay on top of the day-to-day things, Ana.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.73,1:47:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 任凭差遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.13,1:47:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,董事会和生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boardrooms and business deals.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.13,1:47:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那一类克劳馥家的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just not that kind of Croft.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.84,1:48:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,想让我爸爸也和我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither was Dad, as it turns out.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.16,1:48:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面的公司全都是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are all these companies owned by us?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.29,1:48:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.64,1:49:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我知道他们是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know them by name now…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.87,1:49:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣三一秘社\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Order of Trinity.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.04,1:49:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是一个好战的古老组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}An ancient militant organization.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.88,1:49:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻求操纵自然力量的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}that seeks control over the supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.38,1:49:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,而统治全人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}in order to rule the fate of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.72,1:49:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的工作是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of work do you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.89,1:49:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,各种各样的事情 一切听我老板的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, a mix of things. At the mercy of my employer.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.29,1:49:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面的公司全都是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are all these companies owned by us?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.37,1:49:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你谁也救不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not savin' anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.01,1:49:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣三一无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trinity is everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.24,1:49:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这很难接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's difficult to accept.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.27,1:49:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你真的必须来把那些文件签了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you really must come in and sign those papers now.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.74,1:49:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得公司的日常事务还是由你来管理吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'd better stay on top of the day-to-day things, Ana.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.11,1:49:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,任凭差遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.98,1:49:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一能说话的对象就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only person that I get to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.09,1:49:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话另一端的那些家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}is on the other end of this phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.47,1:50:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.40,1:50:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们克劳馥家族肩负重任\N{\fnArial\fs30}We Crofts, we have responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.57,1:50:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有使命需要完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jobs to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.05,1:50:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. You again.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.19,1:50:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要赎回护身符\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came back for the amulet.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.12,1:50:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还指望你忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shame. I was hoping you'd forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.46,1:50:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西可值钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth a bloody fortune.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.26,1:50:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过 今天你撞大运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did tell you it was your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.56,1:50:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.73,1:50:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你又来了 艾伦 - 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- At it again, are we, Alan? - I'm not at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.31,1:50:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好不要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you've noticed or not,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.51,1:50:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh, you can't be too careful these days.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.35,1:50:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为世界已经疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}because the world has gone bloody mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.48,1:51:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢提醒 艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, thank you, Alan.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.95,1:51:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把是HK USP 半自动 9毫米 加长弹夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got there is a HK USP 9 mil. extended mag.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.36,1:51:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的个人最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my personal favorite.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.23,1:51:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.03,1:51:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.23,1:51:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来两把\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take two.
